OL,3,AGTA 6 breaks records as sales top $2bn
OL,4,A- industry estimate
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrand Theft Auto 6 is estimated to have
OL,7,Fbecome the biggest entertainment launch
OL,8,Fin history following the blockbuster
OL,9,Fvideo game's launch on Thursday, after
OL,10,Fa 13-year wait.
OL,12,FPre-orders and first day sales of the
OL,13,Fhighly anticipated open-world
OL,14,Faction-adventure game reached more than
OL,15,F24.5 million units, raking in about
OL,16,F$2.36bn (#1.8bn), according to
OL,17,Fanalytics platform Sensor Tower.
OL,19,FIn comparison, the highest grossing
OL,20,Fmovie so far this year, Spider-Man:
OL,21,FBrand New Day, made $2.5bn over its
OL,22,Fentire run in cinemas.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
